<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{% block title %}Yonzon{% endblock %}</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="{{ asset('css/auth.css') }}" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<div class="auth">
    <aside class="auth__panel">
        <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="auth__brand">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/logo.png') }}" alt="Yonzon logo">
            <span>YONZON</span>
        </a>

        <div class="auth__pitch">
            <span class="auth__eyebrow">Ownership registry</span>
            <h2>Proof that it <em>belongs to you.</em></h2>
            <p>Register what you own, and Yonzon keeps the record: a verifiable claim, a certificate, and a way for a stranger to reach you without ever seeing your name.</p>
        </div>

        <small class="auth__copy">&copy; {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} Yonzon Claim Registry</small>
    </aside>

    <main class="auth__main">
        <div class="auth__card">
            {% block content %}{% endblock %}
        </div>
    </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>